                <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Pathological processes involving any of the <a href="/record/ui?ui=D001808" class="textLink_BLOODVESSELS">BLOOD VESSELS</a> in the cardiac or peripheral circulation. They include diseases of <a href="/record/ui?ui=D001158" class="textLink_ARTERIES">ARTERIES</a>; <a href="/record/ui?ui=D014680" class="textLink_VEINS">VEINS</a>; and rest of the vasculature system in the body.</dd>
            

